# Meta / Instagram + Facebook integration

Manage brand Pages/IG via the `meta` MCP server. Use skill `meta-instagram` and
`.cursor/commands/Meta/`.

## What it can do

Gated by the connected Page token’s permissions (not hardcoded). Typical scopes:
`instagram_basic`, `instagram_content_publish`, `instagram_manage_comments`,
`instagram_manage_messages`, `instagram_manage_insights`, `pages_show_list`,
`pages_read_engagement`, `pages_manage_posts`, `pages_manage_engagement`,
`pages_messaging`, `pages_read_user_content`, `business_management`.

IG: image/carousel/Reels/Stories. FB: feed/photo/video (+ optional schedule).
Also: insights, comments, DMs, token refresh, preview.

## Config (local `.env` only — never commit)

### Single account (default)

| Variable | Purpose |
|----------|---------|
| `META_APP_ID` / `META_APP_SECRET` | Token exchange / debug |
| `META_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN` | Long-lived Page token (~60 days) |
| `META_PAGE_ID` | Facebook Page ID (FB posts + DMs) |
| `META_IG_BUSINESS_ACCOUNT_ID` | Instagram Business/Creator ID |
| `META_ACCOUNT_ID` | Optional slug (default `default`) |

With only one account configured, **`account_id` is optional** on tools — the server
uses that account automatically.

### Multi-account (optional)

Set `META_ACCOUNTS` (JSON array) or `META_ACCOUNTS_FILE`. That **overrides** the
single-account vars. Then every action needs an explicit `account_id` (never guess).

See `.env.example`, `knowledge/_shared/meta-accounts-map.md`, `docs/ONBOARDING.md`.

## Account targeting

- **One account:** omit `account_id` or pass the configured id — either is fine.
- **Several accounts:** call `meta_list_accounts` if unclear; pass `account_id`; do not guess.

## Posting flows

**Instagram:** create container → publish with `confirm=true`. Quota **25 / 24h**.
No native organic schedule.

**Facebook:** `fb_publish_*` with `confirm=true`; optional `scheduled_publish_time`.

## Safety

- Never publish/reply/DM from ambient context — explicit user request only.
- Mutating tools require `confirm=true`.
- Audit: `logs/meta-audit.jsonl`.

## Brand voice

Load matching `knowledge/` ToV (SoulPlus / Maria Lit / Soul Healing Center). Prefer
content-smm for draft captions.

## Token refresh (~60 days)

`meta_debug_account_token` → `meta_refresh_account_token` (`confirm=true`) → update
`META_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN` (or the entry in `META_ACCOUNTS`) → restart MCP.
